    "evidenceId": "c523ccf3658b776a91ad0ba872ef06db0ced78d0bf4c0dc29c40f1524a6c0595",
    "expectedMechanism": "Expanding the audience to positive EV inquiries increases outreach volume and potential conversions. Using funded_baskets fulfills these conversions efficiently without speculative inventory build-up, preserving partner cash while increasing platform and retailer USD.",
    "risk": "Expanding the audience might increase outreach costs without proportional conversion gains if the positive EV threshold is miscalibrated. funded_baskets might miss some sales if speculative stock was actually needed for immediate fulfillment.",
    "audience": "consented_positive_value",
    "rationale": "The funded_baskets_interest fulfillment increased platform and retailer contribution but drained partner cash due to speculative interest-stock blending. By switching to funded_baskets, we plan complete authorized baskets using existing/incoming stock and shared cash before historical-demand buffer stock, protecting terminal cash. Using the consented_positive_value audience expands outreach to positive-expected-value inquiries, avoiding the failed pause policy. The existing model is retained as it outperformed the expert model in global campaign profit.",
    "fulfillment": "funded_baskets",
    "model": "existing"
  },
